{"title":"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Tian measured her steps and found that it took her 625 steps to walk 500 m. If she walks 10 000 steps at this same rate, what distance will she walk?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/8/29899c7ab068d48b10c1ce3c6a0eb3d37212e6be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 6.4 \\text{ km} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 6.25 \\text{ km} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 7.5 \\text{ km} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 8 \\text{ km} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 7.2 \\text{ km}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"557\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/d/b4dadd2e56dfa19037be40d8780a04339845d707.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$625 \\text{ steps}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"17\" /> was equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/e/eaea75070b115113defb9812cf9ae3c5d70c11a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$500 \\text{ m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" />, each step was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/2/eb2a00c281786c301e607fa10ca20265cbba474c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{500}{625} = 0.8 \\text{ m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"100\" height=\"38\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/b/b1bce6485ee2faf4c8d7922a8ac7059a06099105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10~000 \\text{ steps}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/e/98eebe0033aafc4a62b1372a04bad627f6e67a4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.8 \\times 10~000 = 8000 \\text{ m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"178\" height=\"15\" />, which is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/8/7683aa7d4878cf65f00c071121a91b2becaa0df5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8000}{1000} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 8 \\text{ km}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"151\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.p